      "text": "There is further prayer for directions to pay interest to the petitioner at the rate as provided by the Land Acquisition Act, 1894 over the amount of part of the S.R.P. from February 2009 when the award was announced, till the date of the amount of part of S.R.P. has been paid to the petitioner in December 2021.",
